{
  "lang": "en",
  "film": "Hamlet",
  "source_rel": "Greatest Acting Monologues Of All Time PART 3/Greatest Acting Monologues Of All Time PART 3.mp4",
  "t_start_global": 2635.83,
  "t_end_global": 2842.04,
  "duration": 206.21,
  "clip": "Hamlet.mp4",
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.1,
      "text": "To be or not to be.",
      "filename": "segment001.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 1.2,
      "end": 2.02,
      "text": "That is the question.",
      "filename": "segment002.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 6.17,
      "end": 12.13,
      "text": "Whether it is nobler in the mind to suffer the slings and arrows of outrageous fortune.",
      "filename": "segment003.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 16.28,
      "end": 19.28,
      "text": "Or to take arms against a sea of troubles.",
      "filename": "segment004.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 21.22,
      "end": 24.44,
      "text": "And by opposing, end them.",
      "filename": "segment005.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 26.93,
      "end": 27.69,
      "text": "To die.",
      "filename": "segment006.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 33.83,
      "end": 34.53,
      "text": "No more.",
      "filename": "segment007.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 38.95,
      "end": 42.43,
      "text": "And by a sleep to say we ended.",
      "filename": "segment008.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 43.21,
      "end": 48.23,
      "text": "The heartache and the thousand natural shocks that flesh is heir to.",
      "filename": "segment009.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 50.62,
      "end": 52.47,
      "text": "It is a consummation.",
      "filename": "segment010.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 54.19,
      "end": 55.85,
      "text": "Devoutly to be wished.",
      "filename": "segment011.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 59.34,
      "end": 60.27,
      "text": "To die.",
      "filename": "segment012.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 63.17,
      "end": 63.83,
      "text": "To sleep.",
      "filename": "segment013.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 70.25,
      "end": 71.49,
      "text": "To sleep.",
      "filename": "segment014.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 71.85,
      "end": 73.05,
      "text": "A chance to dream.",
      "filename": "segment015.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 73.67,
      "end": 75.35,
      "text": "I is the rub.",
      "filename": "segment016.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 78.59,
      "end": 82.51,
      "text": "Or in that sleep of death what dreams may come.",
      "filename": "segment017.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 83.39,
      "end": 86.27,
      "text": "When we have shuffled off this mortal coil.",
      "filename": "segment018.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 86.75,
      "end": 88.13,
      "text": "Must give us pause.",
      "filename": "segment019.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 88.63,
      "end": 89.79,
      "text": "There's respect.",
      "filename": "segment020.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 90.81,
      "end": 94.47,
      "text": "That makes calamity of so long life.",
      "filename": "segment021.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 98.42,
      "end": 100.88,
      "text": "Or who would bear the whips and scorns of death?",
      "filename": "segment022.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 100.88,
      "end": 102.04,
      "text": "The scorns of time.",
      "filename": "segment023.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 102.96,
      "end": 104.3,
      "text": "The oppressor's wrong.",
      "filename": "segment024.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 104.48,
      "end": 106.48,
      "text": "The proud man's contumely.",
      "filename": "segment025.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 107.66,
      "end": 110.16,
      "text": "The pains of despised love.",
      "filename": "segment026.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 110.3,
      "end": 111.16,
      "text": "The law's delay.",
      "filename": "segment027.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 111.3,
      "end": 112.54,
      "text": "The insolence of office.",
      "filename": "segment028.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 112.66,
      "end": 113.96,
      "text": "And the spurns.",
      "filename": "segment029.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 114.66,
      "end": 118.58,
      "text": "That patient merit of the unworthy takes.",
      "filename": "segment030.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 123.29,
      "end": 127.33,
      "text": "He himself might his quietus make.",
      "filename": "segment031.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 130.45,
      "end": 131.07,
      "text": "Bodkin.",
      "filename": "segment032.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 138.1,
      "end": 147.16,
      "text": "Who would fartles bear to grunt and sweat under a weary life.",
      "filename": "segment033.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 148.32,
      "end": 152.46,
      "text": "But at the dread of something after death.",
      "filename": "segment034.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 154.38,
      "end": 160.64,
      "text": "The undiscovered country from whose born no traveler returns.",
      "filename": "segment035.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 161.08,
      "end": 162.68,
      "text": "Puzzles the will.",
      "filename": "segment036.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 163.82,
      "end": 168.56,
      "text": "And makes us rather bear those ills we have.",
      "filename": "segment037.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 169.12,
      "end": 172.24,
      "text": "Than fly to others that we know not of.",
      "filename": "segment038.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 176.71,
      "end": 181.11,
      "text": "Thus conscience does make cowards of us all.",
      "filename": "segment039.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 183.09,
      "end": 190.41,
      "text": "And thus the native hue of resolution is sicklied o'er with a pale cast of thought.",
      "filename": "segment040.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 192.07,
      "end": 195.49,
      "text": "And enterprises of great pitch and moment.",
      "filename": "segment041.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 196.15,
      "end": 200.67,
      "text": "With this regard their currents turn awry.",
      "filename": "segment042.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 203.41,
      "end": 206.21,
      "text": "And lose the name of action.",
      "filename": "segment043.mp4"
    }
  ]
}